<title>UK: Petrobras sets 1.25 bln Austrian schilling bond.</title>
<headline>Petrobras sets 1.25 bln Austrian schilling bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Creditanstalt Investment Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PETROBRAS</p>
<p> AMT   1.25 BLN ATS   COUPON     9.00	MATURITY    31.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.875    PAY DATE    31.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     LISTING    LUX/VIE   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> GOV LAW    AUSTRIAN  HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	320 BP OVER AUSTRIAN GOVERNMENT BONDS.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
